#: tutorindigo/templates/indigo/lms/templates/static_templates/about.html:14
msgid ""
"WikiLearn, hosted by the Wikimedia Foundation, is a dedicated learning "
"platform for the Wikimedia movement. It offers a comprehensive range of "
"self-paced and instructor-led courses aimed at capacity building and "
"leadership development within the Wikimedia community. Courses on WikiLearn "
"are collaboratively developed by and for Wikimedians with a commitment to "
"accessibility and diversity. For inquiries, contact the Community "
"Development team at "
msgstr ""
"WikiLearn是由维基媒体基金会托管、用于维基媒体运动的专用学习平台。它提供了全方位的自己决定进度、由导师指引的课程，以在维基媒体社区中培养能力、发展领导力。WikiLearn上的课程由维基人协作开发并面向维基人群体，致力于可及性与多样性。若需询问，请联系社区开发团队：\\"

